d pick with me and he started  or I think he started like the fourth  preseason game against the Bears will  right down the field we scored a  touchdown and everyone's thinking and  you know the next Peyton Manning and  nothing against Brady at all but when  you're in the preseason we look back at  the film and they played cover to  legitimately the entire game so he kept  taking the middle throw through the  running back which is as everybody knows  and cover to is always open so they  don't adjust in the preseason you're not  gonna see that ever happened in a  regular season game so it's just not  even apples to apples when you're  talking about a regular season in a  preseason game because preseason they're  just gonna let you take whatever you  want  they've got a few things they want to  work on in the game and they're just  gonna let the chips fall where they may  and that'll never happened in the  regular season  good Brady Quinn out Ben Chu there is no  doubt especially now I'm kind of weak  right now I lost a lot of weight what is  the funniest thing that ever happened in  the huddle is you never missed a snap so  you were there for just about every play  funniest thing that ever happened was  when Josh Johnson came into the huddle  maybe a week after we signed him and  nobody in that huddle knew who knew his  name because did you ever help up a  court I don't think you gave up how many  sacks did you give up in your career did  you ever pick up did did you ever pick  up the quarterback and just say my bad  after your guy got him I have it yeah I  had a rule I would never pick the  quarterback up because even if it was my  fault I felt like it was still a little  bit his fault so he should have a little  bit of that and get himself up I think  the over-under is five wins on the  Browns this year what do you got I got  the over over all day see so you got him  at like six wins you know I said I've  had him at eight  Wow a little while I like that right now  